{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1529844-what-if-cofd-splat-exist-in-the-new-world","id":1529844,"title":"What if CofD splat exist in the New World?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-01T20:54:01-08:00","id":1529844,"title":"What if CofD splat exist in the New World?","content":"Anything World of Darkness related in the New World before the Year 1000 A.D. doesn't exist or happen, and there is a Meta-Physical Barrier that pervent stuff from the Old World to affect the New World and vice versa, in the Year 1000 A.D. the Barrier is thin, and in the Year 1500 A.D. the Barrier is broken.<br /> This is the New Timeline I came up with, if there is anything that wouldn't or would happen, please correct me, I'm not familiar with Old World of Darkness aside from the few surface stuff. And mind you these thing only happen in the New World.<br /> 5,500 B.C.: The First Mage Awaken since after the Fall of Atlantis.<br /> 5,000 B.C.: The Suddering Happen.<br /> 4,500 B.C.: The start of Irem Empire.<br /> 4,000 B.C.: New World Kindred Clan started to form.<br /> 3,500 B.C.: The First Changeling to Escape from Arcadia.<br /> 3,000 B.C.: The First Promethean created.<br /> 2,500 B.C.: The Fall of Irem Empire, and The Creation of the Arisen.<br /> 2,400 B.C.: The Underworld Ocean start to become lower, and The First Bound is created.<br /> 2,300 B.C.: The First Deviant was created on accident.<br /> 2,200 B.C.: The Begotten first appear.<br /> 2,100 B.C.: The First Unchain to Descent on Earth.<br /> 2,000 B.C.: The Formation of the Atlantean Diamond<br /> 100 B.C.: The First Conspiracy, The Aegis Kai Doru was formAnything World of Darkness related in the New World before the Year 1000 A.D. doesn't exist or happen, and there is a Meta-Physical Barrier that pervent stuff from the Old World to affect the New World and vice versa, in the Year 1000 A.D. the Barrier is thin, and in the Year 1500 A.D. the Barrier is broken.<br /> This is the New Timeline I came up with, if there is anything that wouldn't or would happen, please correct me, I'm not familiar with Old World of Darkness aside from the few surface stuff. And mind you these thing only happen in the New World.<br /> The name of Organization, Clan, Order, etc are different, but the core concept of them are still the largely same, with some minor tweak to fit the new Timeline.<br /> 6,000 B.C.: Dreaded Horror stalk the New World<br /> 5,500 B.C.: The First Mage Awaken since after the Fall of Atlantis.<br /> 5,000 B.C.: The Suddering Happen.<br /> 4,500 B.C.: The start of Irem Empire.<br /> 4,000 B.C.: New World Kindred Clan started to form.<br /> 3,500 B.C.: The First Changeling to Escape from Arcadia.<br /> 3,000 B.C.: The First Promethean created.<br /> 2,500 B.C.: The Fall of Irem Empire, and The Creation of the Arisen.<br /> 2,400 B.C.: The Underworld Ocean start to become lower, and The First Bound is created.<br /> 2,300 B.C.: The First Deviant was created on accident.<br /> 2,200 B.C.: The Begotten and their Family first appear.<br /> 2,100 B.C.: The First Unchain to Descent on Earth.<br /> 2,000 B.C.: The Formation of the Pentacle Order.<br /> 1,900 B.C.: The First Conspiracy, The Aegis Kai Doru was form<br /> 1,800 B.C.: The Covenant were form.<br /> 1,700 B.C.: The First Changeling Court was founded.<br /> 1,600 B.C.: The Bound Archetype were created.<br /> 1,500 B.C.: The Ascending One was form.<br /> 1,400 B.C.: Les Myst\u00e8res was form.<br /> 1,300 B.C.: The Cheiron Group was form.<br /> 1,200 B.C.: The Lucifuge was form.<br /> 1,100 B.C.: Task Force: VALKYRIE was form.<br /> 1,000 B.C.: Malleus Malficarum was form.<br /> 950 B.C.: The Knights of Saint George was form.<br /> 900 B.C.: The Faithful of Shulpae was form.<br /> 850 B.C.: The Cainite Heresy was form.<br /> 800 B.C.: The Merrick Institute was form.<br /> 750 B.C.: Hototogisu was form.<br /> 700 B.C.: The Knight of St. Adrain was form.<br /> 650 B.C.: Aves Minerva was form.<br /> 600 B.C.: Otodo was form<br /> 550 B.C.: V.A.S.C.U. was form<br /> 500 B.C.: Asclepeion was form<br /> 450 B.C.: Campion Wildlife Service was form.<br /> 400 B.C.: The Council of Bone was form<br /> 350 B.C.: Engimatic was form<br /> 300 B.C.: Operation Nebula was form.<br /> 250 B.C.: Survivor Club was form.<br /> 200 B.C.: Watcher was form<br /> 150 B.C.: White Hare Society was form<br /> 100 B.C.: The False Alliance was form<br /> 50 B.C.: The Sworn Alliance was form<br /> 1 B.C.-1A.D.: The Contagion Appear in the New World<br /> 25 A.D.: Ashwood Abbey was form<br /> 50 A.D.: The Barrett Commision was form<br /> 75 A.D.: Bear Lodge was form<br /> 100 A.D.: Division Six was form.<br /> 125 A.D.: Habibti Ma was form.<br /> 150 A.D.: Heritage House was born.<br /> 175 A.D.: The Hunt Club was form.<br /> 200 A.D.: The Night Watch was form.<br /> 225 A.D.: Network Zero was form.<br /> 250 A.D.: Null Mysteriis was form.<br /> 275 A.D.: The Promethean Brotherhood was form.<br /> 300 A.D.: The Reckoning was form<br /> 325 A.D.: The Talbot Group was form<br /> 350 A.D.: The Union was form<br /> 375 A.D.: Utopia Now was form<br /> 400 A.D.: Yuri's Group was form.<br /> 425 A.D.: Ahl al-Jabal was form<br /> 450 A.D.: Ama-san was form<br /> 475 A.D.: Azusa Miko was form<br /> 500 A.D.: Bijin was form<br /> 525 A.D.: Followers of the Mansa was form<br /> 550 A.D.: Keepers of the Weave was form<br /> 575 A.D.: Protectors of the Light was form<br /> 600 A.D.: The Scarlet Watch was form<br /> 625 A.D.: Soldiers of the Forbidden Sun was form.<br /> 650 A.D.: Les Voyageurs was form.<br /> 675 A.D.: Crimson Halo was form.<br /> 700 A.D.: Crossroads Convoy was form<br /> 725 A.D.: Eden Covenant was form<br /> 750 A.D.: Las Guada\u00f1as was form<br /> 775 A.D.: Nine Stars was form<br /> 800 A.D.: Recalibrators was form<br /> 825 A.D.: SWORN was form.<br /> 850 A.D.: The Contagion worsen<br /> 875 A.D.: The Sworn Alliance have the upper hand.<br /> 900 A.D.: The Sworn Alliance have major advantage.<br /> 925 A.D.: The War between The Sworn Alliance and The Flase Alliance began.<br /> 950 A.D.: The War rage on, with The Sworn having a clear advantage<br /> 975 A.D.: The War end with The Sworn Aliiance as the victor<br /> 1,000 A.D.: Viking Colony set up in the New World.<br /> 1,050 A.D.: The Viking Colony was destroy by the Contagion.<br /> 1,100 A.D.: The Bound start the reformation of the Underworld<br /> 1,150 A.D.: Changeling Courts start to make new home in the Hedge.<br /> 1,200 A.D.: The Pentacle Order start the process of breaking the Lie.<br /> 1,250 A.D.: The Peacemaking of the Forsaken and The Pure Tribe start.<br /> 1,300 A.D.: Hunter Organization start to recruit Non-Human.<br /> 1,350 A.D.: The Kindred start to be more open with Mortal and other Supernatural<br /> 1,400 A.D.: The Contagion is the worst it's have ever been<br /> 1,450 A.D.: The SWORN Alliance Cure the Final Contagion<br /> 1500 A.D.: Columbus discover the New World, bringing with him Vampire, Werewolf, Changeling, and Mage.<br /> <br /> From Diary of Old World Vampire<br /> The Mortal and Supernatural of the New World act differently, they're more of a living story than actual people.<br /> The Mortal of The New World are strange People, they actively try to ignore all of The weirdness around them, while also being kind of weird themselve, Mortal in the New World are more likely to have Supernatural power than their Old World Counterpart, and having Strange yet not Supernatural abilities that can't be found in the Old World, and their Soul is made of a different stuff than those of the Old World.<br /> The Vampire of the New World aren't Cainite of Our, they seem at first glance like Kine, but the look in their eye are those of soulless husk, but they aren't soulless, I can still feel it, deep inside of them, and they seem to be even more open than those of the Old World, I fear that not even the Camarilla can Masquerade these Blood Sucker.<br /> The New World should be exciting, but I feel weaker than I have ever been, I can't shut down Mortal Body fuction anymore, the most Powerful Discipline I can use is to Mesmerise, but I have been feeding more than I ever had, but I still can't manage anything more than that.<br /> Is this Place curse? A few night ago I was exploring the Jungle, when I find some sort of Artifact, when I pick it up, not a moment later, my arms were cut off, thankfully I manage to escape who ever did that to me, but my arms are still regenerating, so who or what ever it was that did this me, I hope I never encounter it again.<br /> This is may be my final entry, for I am doom, The Mortal of the New World can become being call 'Hunter', these Mortal are fuel by something called the 'Vigil', and are govern by 'The Code', The 'Cell' are the lowest rank in Hunter Society, they are mostly Mortal with the exception that their Aura look like Green Flame. The 'Compact' are the Middle Rank of Hunter Society, they are kind of the same as The 'Cell' but have more Resource, Information, and Manpower than any 'Cell', the 'Vigil' seem to engulf deep into their psyche, buring the Horror and Power I use against them off their Mind. But the one you should truly fear are the 'Conspiracy' these 'Hunter' are the most unnatural thing I found, yet they call themselve 'Human', The 'Vigil' burn in their Soul, which slowly change their apperance and give them power, which they call 'Endowment', I have 3 Conspiracy and 5 Compact Hunting me down, I fear that I might not make it another night.<br /> <br /> Diary of Old World Werewolf<br /> The New World have no trace of the Triat taint anywhere, even in the Mortal, who have exibit the same trait as those in the Old World have no sign of taint whatsoever, but they seem to be immnue to our Delirium, but that nothing to be worry about right?<br /> Today I've seen a Mortal who kill 3 tigers with his bare hand, and I swear that I have seen The Tigers bite into him multiple time, but somehow he is still standing, he doesn't seem to be any different from normal Mortal, but I don't think I will be near him anytime soon.<br /> I see now why the New World have no sign of taint, the Umbra take it's all in, The Garou of the New World or Uratha as they like to call themselve, are of no help what so ever, they even seem to eat spirit, they seem to worship The Moon and some Father Wolf, and the Fera of the New World are the same, they doesn't even seem to care about the Spirit, and I swear one of them look like a domesticated dog.<br /> I smell a creature, they smell like a creation of The Weaver, but I don't even smell anything like taint from them, only an unholy combination of Flesh and Machine, I can't really do any about them at the moment, since they so dang good at hiding from me, but once I can corner it, it's the end for them.<br /> I didn't expect my last day to come this early, or to be hunted down by 'human' or they at least they like to pretend that they are, I'm currently being hunted down by a group of 'Hunter' who want to harvest my part for some reason, and under normal circumstance, I could kill these 'Hunter' within a Hour, but I just realized how weak I feel being in this place, and these 'Hunter' have something tainting their soul, I don't know if it's Wyrm, Weaver, or Wyld, but it's definently something similiar, and that would explain their inhuman look, but this is probably the end of me, I have a good run, but I will not die hiding, I will die as Gaia Warrior.<br /> <br /> Diary of Old World Mage<br /> The Mortal of the New World are quite strange, they don't have any avatar in them, and they don't make me suffer any sort of paradox when they see me using magic, and even a few of them can use some sort of sorcery themself.<br /> Today I've seen a fight between some Mortal, when I a naked lady came up to them, and ask them stop the fighting, some of those Mortal start to beat her up, but when she said &quot;You're being seen&quot; They seem to stop, and other Mortal watching the fight start to chant the same thing the women said, causing the fight to end, she is no Mage, but something about her isn't right.<br /> I found the so call 'Mage' of the New World, but they have a power akin to High Power Sorcerer than anything else, they seem to have some kind of path that they go through, but I could feel that they soul have no Avatar, so I wouldn't borther with them.<br /> I have seen some sort of creature that look like Mortal have Power of the Mind beyond my capabilities, I try to see into their Soul, but what I see was a Soul so unstable that it's make me barf, thankfully I came out of the encounter alive, since it's was too busy throwing Boulder at some Mortal.<br /> I'm dead, there is no escaping that now, I'm currently being hunted by some group know as 'Hunter' who seem to be able to detect my use of Magic, and they want to eat me, yet I can't do a single thing to save myself, so I will use the last of power I have left to make sure that this Diary is safe, so other will be more prepare than I am.<br /> <br /> Diary of Old World Changeling.<br /> The New World is Great, it's have No sign of Banality, but their seem to be no Dreaming here either?<br /> I try to reap some Dreaming from a Mortal, but his mind was like a fortress, that I can't get in, I escape before he decide to alert any one else.<br /> I saw something strange today, I see somesort of Creature of Dreaming went into a Mirror, so I went after her, but what on the other side of the Mirror was a Hegde Maze, that I barely survive, thank goodness I found these stair.<br /> Good New, the Stair lead me into somekind of Dream. Bad New, it's more of a Nightmare than a Dream, and I can't escape Nightmare so easily, thankfully, some sort of Unseelie Changeling help me get out of there.<br /> This place is bad, real bad, their are people who called themselve 'Hunter' Everywhere.<br /> <br /> 1510 A.D.: Columbus return to the Old World with most of his crew dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T09:10:53-08:00","id":1529856,"title":"","content":"I don't understand what you're going for here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T09:15:54-08:00","id":1529857,"title":"","content":"I'm testing a setting for my game, but I don't know about World of Darkness enough, the setting is that All of Chronicle of Darkness are in World of Darkness New World, but there was a metaphysical barrier that seperate the Old World and The New World, in the 1500 A.D., the Barrier was broken, but all of Old World of Darkness supernatural power halve in the New World, and they can't use advance power in the New World.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-08T06:27:34-08:00","id":1530269,"title":"","content":"So it's not uncommon to mix the two main Worlds of Darkness (let's set MCWoD and Exalted aside, they generally are), either just mixing the lines together or combining the counterparts (I believe Masquiem is particularly popular). You don't really need an excuse, even in WoD the lines are mostly self contained and you can generally find a good enough counterpart for any organisations exiled from continuity (the Ravnos Ante can believably be destroyed by either the Pentacle or Seers, for example).<br /> <br /> If you want conflict between the two Worlds, or one of the Worlds and Exalted, then that can be done. It's probably easiest to use the Translation Guides to run as much as possible with one set of mechanics and homebrew what's not covered, which means you just need a plot. My view would be to abuse the Technocracy and assorted ends of the lines, where the world's don't co-existing but a Technocracy failsafe ends with the creatures and organisation of the old world somehow appearing in the new world. The ones with the biggest shock are the Mages, magic just doesn't work like that anymore and none have connections to the Watchtowers that would allow the use of Supernal magic (yet). But everyone has to deal with a world that isn't so much unaware as willfully ignorant","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}